			"notes": "# The very first (Pre)release of Armorium! 🎉\nHey!\nI worked on Armorium for almost three months. This is my very first mod.\nIt might be unbalanced at points and unplayable on singleplayer/multiplayer.\n\n> [!CAUTION]\n> Tested in singleplayer only.\nNo compatibility testing with other mods.\nConflicts are possible.\nNot ready for public use.\n\n\n## Content:\n- Ruby armor set\n- Ruby blocks\n- Drills\n- Multitool, vein miner implementation.\n- Achievable (in survival) status effects.\n- Proof of concept / WIP status effects.\n\nThis is only the first release that is in a state of playability. \nI'm planning on making so much more content but I don't have a lot of time, don't expect frequent releases.\n\nPlans: Much more armors and tools, temporary and permanent powers and status effects, and accessories.\n\nThe mod will be released only on [Modrinth](https://modrinth.com/mod/armorium) at this point! may come to curseforge."
		}
